(lib_symbols)
(text "REV W: 288V 32GB / FICTIONAL PEX90064 / THUNDERBOLT 3 HOST\nPEX90064 has an invented 1024-ball map. 12 E1.S x4 plus CPU x4; 12 spare lanes. Nominal SSD side/bottom gap 7.25mm. TB3 host: Alpine Ridge DP + TPS65982. USB face positions 12/24mm. Real CPU rails retained; reference fake-switch regulators added. CPU PMIC / BIOS / NVM / SI qualification pending.\nCPU pin directions and power inputs are modeled. ERC power-driver errors expose unfinished supply domains.\nSee README.md and VALIDATION.json before manufacturing." (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "77d1896d-8bfe-4e56-81a6-5576c22a0144"))
